        "title": "Copilot Studio Agent Academy - Recruit Level",
        "excerpt":"Comprehensive 13-lesson curriculum covering agents, LLMs, declarative &amp; custom agents, Topics, Adaptive Cards, Agent Flows, and deployment to Teams and Microsoft 365 Copilot   External Repository   This lab is hosted in an external repository. Click the link below to access the full lab content:   Repository: microsoft/agent-academy   Lab Details      Duration: 240 minutes   Difficulty: 200   Type: External Lab   Getting Started      Navigate to the external repository   Follow the README instructions in that repository   Complete the lab exercises as directed     This is an external lab. All content and instructions are maintained in the linked repository.  ","categories": [],
